-- mod-individual-progression restores Vanilla-era elite status for outdoor creatures
-- globally (modules/mod-individual-progression/data/sql/world/base/vanilla_creatures.sql
-- and tbc_creatures.sql), e.g. the Dun Garok guards. These creatures were de-elited in
-- WotLK 3.3.5a (base data rank=0). Revert every creature_template column the mod changed
-- for the 278 affected open-world creatures back to the base WotLK values,
-- so outdoor elites match the WotLK experience again.
